WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,560
King Kong Eight strokes Guo Deqiang, you will give two survival coins

2
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:05,160
The little prince Zhaotai gives you two survival coins

3
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:07,120
Boss, I sent you the upgrade fragments.

4
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:08,160
Leave me a set too

5
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:10,680
I have to be a big boss. I finally got out of the car and opened the box.

6
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:13,420
Isn’t this guy freezing to death?

7
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:14,460
Why don't you change it?

8
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:16,620
Boss, I don’t have enough fragments or survival coins.

9
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:18,620
But I have a prop. See if you can use it.

10
00:00:18,620 --> 00:00:19,740
Potion pot props

11
00:00:19,740 --> 00:00:22,460
Put all basic medicines related to treatment in the compartment

12
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:23,740
every 24 hours

13
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:25,980
A brand new medicine will be copied

14
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:28,460
This thing can infinitely copy detoxifying mosquitoes and antipyretics

15
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:30,180
The value is much greater than the fragments

16
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:32,500
Send it over. I'll give you a green fur suit.

17
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:38,130
The young master of service initiates a transaction. Do you agree?

18
00:00:38,130 --> 00:00:42,200
By the way, I remember that I got a recovery pill that healed me instantly.
